          "text": "Resonant ring-down\nRun 8 s at 1024 Hz; open Time–frequency viewer → Analyze / freeze.\nAn impulse starts a decaying oscillation near 16 Hz; find its transient ridge.\nCompare STFT and Morlet CWT; gray means incomplete support, not zero energy.",
